WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.435
-Now, I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.903
#MyWeirdTeacher stories
from you guys.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.572
Here we go. The first one is
from @Steve-Shu.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.641
He says, "The day after
we turned in drafts

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.077
of our term papers,
the professor wore all black

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.078
to signify his
disappointment in our work."

00:00:13.078 --> 00:00:16.449
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.118
-He had to tell them, too.

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.318
Wouldn't figure that
one out for yourself.

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:20.887
-I'm mourning the loss
of your grades, yeah.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.122
This one is from @JonBalun.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:25.492
He said, "My teacher moved
his left hand in circles

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.193
as he erased the board
with his right hand

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.961
so he would build
the muscles evenly."

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:32.231
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:35.334
-Wax on, wax off.

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:37.770
-Miyagi.
Miyagi, yeah.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:41.073
This one is from @tinagibala.

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:44.277
She says, "My homeroom teacher
kept a list on the chalkboard

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.812
of people who needed
prom dates."

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.847
-Aw.
[ Audience aws ]

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.417
[ Applause ]
Oh.

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:51.818
Tina?

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:54.053
You and Gary.
-Derek's been up here for --

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.788
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:58.624
For three weeks now.
So anyone wants -- Anyone.

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:00.760
You know anyone who wants
to go with Derek, or any --

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.229
Do you have any pets at home
that could maybe go with Derek?

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.732
Just so he doesn't go alone.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.733
This one is from @leighlo-maria.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.735
She said, "My biology teacher
handed us back

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:12.238
our graded homework.
Every paper was maroon.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.206
She apparently spilled
a bottle of red wine."

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:16.175
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:18.544
-Yoinks!

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:19.579
[ Pop ]

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:25.517
-This one's from @Corcorcoran2.

00:01:25.517 --> 00:01:27.686
He says, "If it was your
birthday, my teacher would draw

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:30.189
a cake on the board and ask you
to blow out the candles.

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:32.425
You just had to stand there
and blow on the chalkboard

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.193
until he said
the candles went out."

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:35.662
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.630
Not yet!
-Not yet!

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.999
-Not yet, keep going.
[ Laughs ]

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.201
-Not yet!
-[ Fake crying ]

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:45.371
-Okay. Oh, they're trick
candles, they're back on again.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:46.806
What's your problem, dude?

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.741
-I'm in charge!
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.444
I'm the boss, get it?

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:54.247
This one's from @HBP-ALWAYS98.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.815
She says, "Whenever I ask my
teacher what we're doing today,

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:59.051
she says, 'working hard
and suffering greatly,

00:01:59.051 --> 00:02:00.353
because life is pain.'"

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.321
-Oh.
[ Applause ]

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:04.624
Wow!
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:08.995
This one's from @mac-ken-cheese.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.363
-Oh, nice.
-I get it.

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:12.565
Not bad.
Mac n' cheese.

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.199
-Mac n' cheese.
-Mac Ken Cheese.

00:02:14.199 --> 00:02:16.269
-Nice one.
-That's a nice one.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.137
-Yeah.

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:19.605
-mac-ken-cheese.

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:23.076
She says, "My chemistry teacher
had a taxidermied armadillo

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.111
in the classroom.
For a while, it wore a party hat

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:26.412
and it was called
The Partydillo."

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.481
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah!

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.316
-Whoop whoop whoop!

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:34.787
-Partydillo!
-Byeh, byeh, byeh, byeh!

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.956
-Raise the roof, Derek!

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:44.597
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.366
-The armadillo said that?
-Yeah.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.366
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.366 --> 00:02:51.671
-This is from @RaskolnikovsAxe.

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:52.905
-Ooh, deep.

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:54.907
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:57.176
A little crime and punishment.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.778
Derek.

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:01.347
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.583
-He says, "At the end
of a test period,

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:05.317
our science teacher would
respond to our

00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:07.987
'one more sec, one more sec!'
with 'no more secs!'"

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:09.054
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.054 --> 00:03:11.357
"No more secs
in this classroom!"

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.325
[ Applause ]

00:03:13.325 --> 00:03:14.427
I'm talking to you, Derek.

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:16.929
-Yeah.

00:03:16.929 --> 00:03:19.799
This last one's
from @TheDonald-Stump.

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:21.200
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.369
He says, "My teacher would tell
us to work hard in math

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.204
and science classes,
otherwise we'd end up

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:27.406
as a gym teacher.
He was also the gym teacher."

00:03:27.406 --> 00:03:28.440
-Oh!
-There you go.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.042
There are your
"Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:03:30.042 --> 00:03:31.043
To check out more
of our favorites,

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:34.080 line:0%
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

